      <p class="route-row route-row--violet"><span>What earns trust</span>Certificates only.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--gold"><span>Watch out</span>Time lost.</p>
      <p class="route-row route-row--teal"><span>How it grows</span>Build one project.</p>
